        {
            "+content": "Authentic Manga, Born in India. The legendary master thief Goemon—who's been taking the streets by storm—collides with the villainous Whiskers gang over a \"relic\" held by a young monk named Bao. Just when pushed into an absolute corner, a second personality sleeping deep within Goemon awakens, blasting enemies away with an unconscious, powerful kung-fu kick... Where will this wild adventure take this pair of lovable fools. Presented by the Silver Award winner in the \"Wordless Manga Contest\"—which drew 1,126 entries from 104 countries and regions worldwide—comes a non-stop action comedy.",
